  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_StA14g</defName>
    <label>StA-14 Battle Rifle</label>
    <description>Technically older than the helghan Empire by a few decades, Stahl Arms' first rifle was an acclaimed hit. The corporate authority of the time wanted an accurate, low ROF weapon capable of outranging foes to protect Helghast lives. As Visari's regime changed doctrine, this battle rifle remained an oddity- never being fully replaced, and consistently performing well in trials. In time these were shifted to rear echelon homeworld reservist forces, only for it again to see service in the defense of Helghan. This weapon did much to convince the burgeoning regime to grant Stahl the contracting rights to the Sta-52. Even today it remains popular in rimworld colonies as a hunting piece.</description>
