    <label>StA-52 Light Assault Rifle</label>
    <description>The StA-52 is in some ways what put Stahl Arms on the map and made them the megacorporation they are today. Seen in every single armed conflict the Helghast have been involved in, its a bold design, a bullpup with a quick swap helical glass magazine, integrated red dot optic, and underslung shotgun. By urb standards, it is simply excellent, suffering only slightly in weight, accuracy, and production cost/complexity.</description>
